Chapter: ErpScenarioTest
  cites ERP chapter ErpScenario

 Battery entry point for the month-in-the-life scenario. The golden
 expected output asserts the invariants that prove the suite coheres:
 the trial balance balances, assets equal liabilities plus equity
 plus net income, both control accounts clear, the three-way match
 passes, and the closed period rejects postings.

Section: Body

  join-lines : List Text, Integer, Text -> Text
  join-lines (lines) (i) (acc) =
    if i >= list-length lines then acc
    else let sep = if i > 0 then "\n" else ""
    in join-lines lines (i + 1) (acc & sep & list-at lines i)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (join-lines scenario-report 0 "")
  end
